        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "This policy position weighs positive year-three benchmark reading and math findings against the lack of a statistically significant same-school retention result. The achievement estimates use a restricted current-and-prior-test sample and are not evidence that every induction duration or implementation will improve outcomes.",
          "language": {
